<title>GERMANY: PAN-GERMAN OCT CPI INFLATION 1.5 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>PAN-GERMAN OCT CPI INFLATION 1.5 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics</p>
<p>Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN CPI INFLATION		 Oct 96     Sept 96     Oct 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 unch	  -0.1	 -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)		 +1.5	  +1.4	 +1.8</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    116.8	 116.8	115.1</p>
<p> FINAL WEST GERMAN CPI INFLATION  Oct 96     Sept 96     Oct 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 unch	  -0.1	 -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)		 +1.5	  +1.4	 +1.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    114.4	 114.4	112.7</p>
<p> EAST GERMAN CPI INFLATION	 Oct 96     Sept 96     Oct 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 unch	  -0.2	 +0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year			    +1.5	  +1.6	 +2.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    135.7	 135.7	133.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>The Office gave the following details:</p>
<p>					    Mth/mth	     Yr/yr</p>
<p>					Oct 98 Sept 96    Oct 96 Sept 96</p>
<p> Food, drink, tobacco	     -0.2    -0.5	+0.7    +0.8</p>
<p> Clothing, shoes		    +0.1    +0.3	+0.7    +0.7</p>
<p> Rents &amp; energy		     +0.5    +0.5	+2.3    +2.0</p>
<p> Of which: rents		    +0.2    +0.2	+2.6    +2.7</p>
<p>	     energy excl. fuel    +1.3    +2.0	+1.1    -0.6</p>
<p> Furniture, household goods     +0.1    unch	+0.7    +0.7</p>
<p> Health and body care goods     +0.1    unch	+1.9    +2.0</p>
<p> Traffic and news transmission  +0.1    +0.1	+2.1    +1.8</p>
<p> Education, leisure goods	 +0.2    +0.3	+0.8    +1.0</p>
<p> Personal equipment, others     -1.5    -3.3	+1.0    +0.9</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
